    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper type for serializing Errors. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>llvm::Errors are move-only, and not inspectable except by consuming them. This makes them unsuitable for direct serialization via <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1shared_1_1_s_p_s_serialization_traits" kindref="compound">SPSSerializationTraits</ref>, which needs to inspect values twice (once to determine the amount of space to reserve, and then again to serialize).</para>
<para>The <ref refid="structllvm_1_1orc_1_1shared_1_1detail_1_1_s_p_s_serializable_error" kindref="compound">SPSSerializableError</ref> type is a helper that can be constructed from an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_error" kindref="compound">llvm::Error</ref>, but inspected more than once. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
